OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers will
OL,6,Fcontinue overnight, these become
OL,7,Ffrequent and heavy at times while
OL,8,Fcontinuing wintry at height. Strong
OL,9,Fnorth to northwest winds and coastal
OL,10,Fgales overnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FAnother day of blustery
OL,13,Fshowers, these wintry over high
OL,14,Fground. Strong winds and coastal gales
OL,15,Fease down from the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
