OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FLess
OL,6,Fcold from Friday. Showers become
OL,7,Fisolated Friday into Saturday morning.
OL,8,FA band of rain will pass southeast
OL,9,FSaturday afternoon. This clears before
OL,10,Ffurther rain pushes northeast Sunday
OL,11,Fafternoon.
